omes and inform strategic planning.","icon":"fa-chart-line","side":"left"}],"sdgs":[{"number":"3","title":"Good Health & Well-Being","desc":"WRC operates free medical camps, maternal health clinics, and emergency healthcare services reaching underserved populations across Pakistan.","color":"green-600","bg":"green","progress":"78","tags":["12,000+ Healthcare Visits","45 Medical Camps"],"icon":"fa-heart-pulse"},{"number":"4","title":"Quality Education","desc":"Through schools, non-formal learning centers, and orphan education sponsorships, WRC ensures children access quality learning opportunities.","color":"red-600","bg":"red","progress":"72","tags":["45,000+ Children Enrolled","120 Learning Centers"],"icon":"fa-graduation-cap"},{"number":"6","title":"Clean Water & Sanitation","desc":"WRC installs hand pumps, deep tube wells, and water purification systems, while training communities in hygiene practices and sanitation management.","color":"blue-600","bg":"blue","progress":"85","tags":["1,200+ Water Wells","180 WASH Committees"],"icon":"fa-faucet-drip"},{"number":"13","title":"Climate Action","desc":"WRC integrates climate resilience into disaster preparedness, promotes renewable energy access, and supports reforestation and environmental restoration projects.","color":"emerald-700","bg":"emerald","progress":"64","tags":["50,000 Trees Planted","15 Solar Installations"],"icon":"fa-leaf"}],"case_studies":[{"image":"../assets/images/water.jpg","category":"WASH","categoryColor":"blue-500","title":"Clean Water for Nowshera: A Community Transformed","desc":"In 2023, WRC installed 35 deep tube wells across 12 villages in Nowshera District, providing clean drinking water to over 8,000 residents previously dependent on contaminated sources.","stats":[{"val":"8,200","label":"People Served"},{"val":"35","label":"Wells Built"},{"val":"12","label":"Villages"}],"quote":"\"Before the wells, my children walked 3 km daily for water that made them sick. Now they have clean water at school and more time to study.\"","author":"— Fatima Bibi, Mother of 4, Nowshera","outcome":"Outcome: Waterborne diseases reduced by 62% in target villages."},{"image":"../assets/images/hero-slider-3.jpg","category":"Education","categoryColor":"red-600","title":"Bright Futures: Orphan Education in Peshawar","desc":"WRC\u0027s orphan sponsorship program enrolled 1,200 children in Peshawar, providing school kits, uniforms, tuition support, and after-school tutoring for 18 months.","stats":[{"val":"1,200","label":"Children Enrolled"},{"val":"92%","label":"Pass Rate"},{"val":"8","label":"Schools"}],"quote":"\"I want to become a doctor. WRC helped me stay in school when my family could not afford it. I am now first in my class.\"","author":"— Ayesha Khan, Student, Grade 8","outcome":"Outcome: 92% exam pass rate; dropout rate reduced from 34% to 4%."},{"image":"../assets/images/food.jpg","category":"Food Security","categoryColor":"amber-500","title":"Emergency Flood Relief in Sindh: Feeding Thousands","desc":"During the 2023 Pakistan floods, WRC distributed 12,000 emergency food packages and set up 8 community kitchens in Sukkhur and Dadu districts within 72 hours.","stats":[{"val":"12,000","label":"Food Packages"},{"val":"48,000","label":"People Fed"},{"val":"72 hrs","label":"Response Time"}],"quote":"\"When the flood destroyed everything, WRC arrived with food for our entire village within three days. They saved us from starvation.\"","author":"— Muhammad Raza, Farmer, Sukkur","outcome":"Outcome: Zero malnutrition deaths in target areas; 100% distribution transparency."}]}'
WHERE id = 1;

